                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make Room to Grow</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Find plants, gardening essentials and outdoor furnishings for every green space</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Everything for Your Garden</h2>\n<p>From healthy plants to practical tools and comfortable patio furniture, find thoughtful picks to help you grow and enjoy your outdoor space. Use our garden essentials to bring a little more green to balconies, backyards and beyond.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Plants and supplies for growing</li>\n    <li>Comfortable furniture for outdoor living</li>\n    <li>Ideas for spaces large and small</li>\n</ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-teaser",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Inspiration for Outdoor Living</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>Discover thoughtful garden picks to help your outdoor space feel welcoming, green and uniquely yours</i></p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Grow Something Good</h3>\n<p>Choose healthy plants and practical gardening essentials to bring new life to your balcony, backyard or garden beds. Find useful picks for every stage, from planting to everyday care.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Make Time to Unwind</h3>\n<p>Complete your outdoor space with comfortable patio furniture and inviting details. Whether you have a spacious garden or a small balcony, create a spot to sit back and enjoy the fresh air.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "position": 4,
