                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make Room to Grow</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Find plants, garden essentials and outdoor comforts for every green space</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Grow a Garden That Feels Like You</h2>\n<p>From healthy plants to practical tools, find the essentials to help your garden flourish. Whether you’re caring for a few pots or tending a backyard, thoughtful choices make every growing season more rewarding.</p>\n<p>Explore useful picks that help you make the most of your outdoor space.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Comfort in Every Corner</h2>\n<p>Bring a little more ease to outdoor living with patio furniture and accessories made for relaxing. A small balcony or spacious backyard can become a welcoming place to unwind.</p>\n<p>Mix greenery and comfortable touches to create an outdoor space you’ll love spending time in.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "center-text",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make Your Outdoor Space Your Own</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">From thriving plants to inviting places to sit, find thoughtful essentials for balconies, backyards and every green space in between.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text-bubble",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Healthy Plants</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Bring fresh colour and life to your garden with plants ready to grow.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Practical Essentials</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Find helpful gardening must-haves to make planting and tending easier.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Outdoor Comfort</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Create a welcoming spot to relax with comfortable patio furniture.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-on-image",
              "position": 5,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<div style=\"padding: 60px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: white; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">Make the Most of Your Outdoors</h2>\n<p style=\"color: white; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">From a few balcony pots to a backyard retreat, discover plants, gardening essentials and comfortable furniture to help your outdoor space bloom.</p>\n</div>"
