              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Plants & Growing</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 0.9em;\">Healthy plants and practical essentials to help your garden thrive</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Garden Inspiration</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 0.9em;\">Explore outdoor ideas, from lush borders to compact balcony displays</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Outdoor Living</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 0.9em;\">Discover patio furniture and finishing touches for relaxing outdoors</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "center-text",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Grow & Style Your Space</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #666;\">Pair useful gardening essentials with inspiring ideas for a space that feels like your own. From planting tips to patio styling, find ways to make every outdoor corner more inviting.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Garden Essentials</h3>\n<p>Find practical picks for growing and caring for your outdoor space:</p>\n<ul style=\"color: #666;\">\n    <li>Plants for gardens and balconies</li>\n    <li>Tools and supplies for everyday gardening</li>\n    <li>Pots and planters for every space</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Comfortable Outdoor Living</h3>\n<p>Make more of your time outside with thoughtful finishing touches:</p>\n<ul style=\"color: #666;\">\n    <li>Patio furniture for relaxing and dining</li>\n    <li>Accessories to add comfort and character</li>\n    <li>Ideas for balconies, backyards and beyond</li>\n</ul>"
                }
