                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Garden Inspiration</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.2em; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Explore ideas and essentials for growing, furnishing and enjoying your outdoor space, from balcony planters to backyard comforts.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Garden Essentials</h2>\n<p>Discover the pieces that help bring every green space to life, with practical picks for planting, relaxing and spending time outdoors:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Plants</strong> - Healthy greenery, flowers and seasonal favorites</li>\n<li><strong>Growing</strong> - Pots, planters and essentials for planting</li>\n<li><strong>Garden Care</strong> - Useful tools and supplies for everyday upkeep</li>\n<li><strong>Outdoor Living</strong> - Comfortable furniture for patios and balconies</li>\n<li><strong>Decor</strong> - Finishing touches to make your space feel like yours</li>\n<li><strong>Small Spaces</strong> - Thoughtful solutions for compact gardens and balconies</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Find Your Outdoor Favorites</h2>\n<p>Browse garden and outdoor living products suited to different spaces, styles and needs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Plants</strong> - Greenery and blooms to suit your space</li>\n<li><strong>Planters</strong> - Options for balconies, patios and gardens</li>\n<li><strong>Patio Furniture</strong> - Comfortable pieces for outdoor relaxing and dining</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; color: #666;\">Explore the categories to find thoughtful picks for your garden and outdoor space.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
